  (text "04_STM32_Controller" (at 15.24 22 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1e2086a-d0ec-5bf5-978b-c28335e6228e"))
  (text "NOTES\n1. bxCAN on F746 = classic CAN only (CAN1/CAN2 used). CAN-FD would need FDCAN MCU or SPI controller.\n2. Encoder timer pins: confirm 5V tolerance of the chosen pins; series resistors on sheet 05.\n3. Power select (E5V vs USB vs VIN) must be set by jumpers per UM1974 - UNVERIFIED here.\n4. SWD for target debug via ST-LINK/CN4 or external header on sheet 08." (at 126.54 50 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53f4115e-96e7-5793-b4b4-e681fa9db738"))
